Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.19,0:18:18.20,Episode 3 Typesetting 3g,Sign,0,0,0,,{=10}{\fs(41)\pos(534.014,205.423)\frz359.6}No Pasar
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.39,0:18:12.39,JoJo-internal/narrator,josu,0,0,0,,¿Qué pasó? La puerta luce diferente…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.84,0:18:15.14,JoJo-internal/narrator,josu,0,0,0,,¿No… asar?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.15,0:18:26.82,JoJo-main,oku,0,0,0,,Deja de retroceder, imbécil.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.82,0:18:30.10,JoJo-main,oku,0,0,0,,Te estás alejando de tu amiguito.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.60,0:18:32.66,JoJo-main,,0,0,0,,Acércate un poco.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.31,0:18:36.71,JoJo-internal/narrator,josu,0,0,0,,Ya veo, falta la "P".
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.71,0:18:40.88,JoJo-main,josu,0,0,0,,¿No será que la mano derecha de tu Stand…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.88,0:18:42.58,JoJo-main,josu,0,0,0,,la hizo desaparecer?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.58,0:18:45.09,JoJo-main,,0,0,0,,¡Tiene el poder de desvanecer el espacio!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.82,0:18:45.95,sign_1,sign,0,0,0,,No    pasar
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.47,0:18:50.42,JoJo-main,some,0,0,0,,¡Así es, Josuke Higashikata!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.42,0:18:54.20,JoJo-main,some,0,0,0,,Todo lo que agarra\Nsu diestra desaparece.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.20,0:19:00.11,JoJo-main,some,0,0,0,,Y se unen las partes\Nque no desaparecieron.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.11,0:19:03.33,JoJo-main,oku,0,0,0,,Mientras que las partes desaparecidas…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.33,0:19:07.86,JoJo-main,oku,0,0,0,,Ni siquiera yo sé dónde terminan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.04,0:19:14.83,JoJo-main,oku,0,0,0,,Y puedo hacer esto\Ncontra los que escapan…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.49,0:19:23.84,JoJo-main,oku,0,0,0,,Si elimino el espacio que nos separa…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.22,0:19:28.93,JoJo-main,oku,0,0,0,,¿Ves? Ahora estoy cerca.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.93,0:19:31.18,JoJo-main,oku,0,0,0,,¡Acabas de teletransportarte!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.33,0:19:40.89,JoJo-main,oku,0,0,0,,Este es el poder del Stand\Nal que tanto teme mi hermano, The Hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.89,0:19:43.40,JoJo-main,oku,0,0,0,,¡Ya no podrás escapar,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.40,0:19:45.32,JoJo-main,oku,0,0,0,,Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.07,0:19:48.74,JoJo-main,oku,0,0,0,,Vayas donde vayas,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.74,0:19:50.24,JoJo-main,oku,0,0,0,,siempre…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.01,0:19:53.24,JoJo-main,oku,0,0,0,,estarás a mi alcance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.28,0:19:59.46,JoJo-main,oku,0,0,0,,Qué débil.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.77,0:20:03.71,JoJo-main,oku,0,0,0,,¿De verdad derrotaste a Angelo?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.14,0:20:15.32,JoJo-main,oku,0,0,0,,Veo que no comprendes que es inútil.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.32,0:20:17.93,JoJo-main,oku,0,0,0,,¡El estúpido eres tú!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.56,0:20:22.07,JoJo-main,oku,0,0,0,,¡Ahora morirás, Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.07,0:20:24.90,JoJo-main,josu,0,0,0,,Lo sabía, no eres muy listo, ¿eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.90,0:20:25.57,JoJo-main,oku,0,0,0,,¿Por qué…?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.17,0:20:46.67,JoJo-main,josu,0,0,0,,Estuviste muy cerca, Okuyasu Nijimura.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.99,0:20:50.38,JoJo-main,josu,0,0,0,,Tu Stand es tan increíble\Ncomo aterrador.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.10,0:20:59.94,Episode 3 Typesetting 3g,Sign,0,0,0,,{=10}{\fs30\pos(1267.728,384.28)\frz0.2587}No  asar
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.10,0:20:59.94,Episode 3 Typesetting 3g,Sign,0,0,0,,{=10}{\fs38\pos(352.014,341.423)\frz358.6}No Pasar
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.35,0:20:54.81,JoJo-main,josu,0,0,0,,No quiero que despierte\Ne intente atacarme.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.21,0:21:00.68,JoJo-main,josu,0,0,0,,Tal vez debería asfixiarlo un poco\Npara asegurarme de que no se levante.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.68,0:21:03.91,JoJo-main,josu,0,0,0,,También dejará plasmada\Nla derrota en su corazón.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.91,0:21:05.30,JoJo-main,josu,0,0,0,,Uno, dos…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.44,0:21:07.90,JoJo-main,josu,0,0,0,,¡Ko-Koichi…!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.66,0:21:16.24,JoJo-main,josu,0,0,0,,Ya fue más que suficiente, miserables.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.63,0:21:30.93,JoJo-main,kei,0,0,0,,Esta flecha es muy valiosa\Ne irreemplazable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.45,0:21:34.05,JoJo-main,kei,0,0,0,,Forma parte de mi objetivo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.86,0:21:38.10,JoJo-main,kei,0,0,0,,La necesito de vuelta.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.17,0:21:44.77,JoJo-internal/narrator,jojo,0,0,0,,De acuerdo a la historia de Angelo,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.77,0:21:48.92,JoJo-internal/narrator,,0,0,0,,este arco y flecha hicieron\Nque brotara el Stand de Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.46,0:21:51.90,JoJo-internal/narrator,jojo,0,0,0,,No hay duda, crearon a The World…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.20,0:21:55.40,JoJo-internal/narrator,jojo,0,0,0,,Alguien los obtuvo\Ntras la muerte de Enyaba,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.40,0:22:01.79,JoJo-internal/narrator,,0,0,0,,y ahora los utiliza para aumentar\Nel número de usuarios de Stand en Morioh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.19,0:22:07.92,JoJo-main,jojo,0,0,0,,Debo destruir ese arco\Ny flecha cuanto antes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.57,0:22:10.99,JoJo-main,jojo,0,0,0,,Para asegurarme de que no nazca…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.99,0:22:17.14,JoJo-main,,0,0,0,,un villano peor que Dio con un Stand\Nmás fuerte que The World…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.34,0:22:52.72,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Any time I need to see your face, I just close my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.72,0:22:54.97,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And I am taken to a place where your crystal mind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.97,0:22:57.77,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And magenta feelings take up shelter in the base of my spine
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.77,0:22:59.44,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sweet like a chic-a-cherry cola
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.44,0:23:01.81,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I don't need to try to explain, I just hold on tight
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.81,0:23:04.19,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And if it happens again, I might move so slightly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.19,0:23:06.98,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}To the arms and the lips and the face of the human cannonball
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.98,0:23:08.69,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}That I need to, I want to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.69,0:23:10.95,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Come stand a little bit closer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.95,0:23:13.28,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Breathe in and get a bit higher
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.28,0:23:14.91,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}You'll never know what hit you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.91,0:23:17.54,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}When I get to you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.54,0:23:22.04,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.04,0:23:25.59,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I'd die to find out
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.59,0:23:31.05,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.05,0:23:34.43,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I would die to find out
